{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/c04dab88c9c98601bd07.json":{"assets":{"mn3/gameplay_story_10626030":{"skip":{"source_cn":"鸭子们都找回来了，威洛松了一口气，还拿出私房钱来感谢你。","text_i18n":{"cn":"鸭子们都找回来了，威洛松了一口气，还拿出私房钱来感谢你。","en":"All the ducks have been found, and Willow is safe from his wife's rage. He even gives you some money as a token of thanks.","jp":"アヒルたちがすべて帰ってきて、ウィローはホッとしてへそくりを取り出し、あなたに謝礼をした。","kr":"오리들을 되찾아오자, 윌로우는 안도의 한숨을 쉬며 감사의 뜻으로 자신의 비상금을 주었다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["10626030"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["22738"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/e6eacf2545e47c4db2fb.json":{"assets":{"mn3/gameplay_story_10626020":{"skip":{"source_cn":"威洛家的鸭子跑出了围栏。他害怕被妻子发现，希望你能帮他尽早找回鸭子。","text_i18n":{"cn":"威洛家的鸭子跑出了围栏。他害怕被妻子发现，希望你能帮他尽早找回鸭子。","en":"Willow's ducks have escaped. He's terrified that his wife will find out and scold him, so he asks you to quietly find the ducks as soon as possible.","jp":"ウィロー家のアヒルが柵から逃げ出してしまった。彼はそれが妻にバレるのを恐れ、あなたにできるだけ早くアヒルを連れ戻してほしいと頼んだ。","kr":"윌로우의 오리가 울타리 밖으로 도망갔다. 아내에게 들킬까 봐 두려웠던 그는 최대한 빨리 오리를 찾아달라고 부탁했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["10626020"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["22737"]}}}},"locales/cn/mn3/gameplay_story/10626010.json":{"asset_key":"mn3/gameplay_story_10626010","episode":"mn3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10626010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1062601001:0":{"text":"我家的鸭子呢？？","source_cn":"我家的鸭子呢？？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F133063C70D8553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:难民威洛":{"text":"难民威洛","source":"难民威洛","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/cn/mn3/gameplay_story/10626020.json":{"asset_key":"mn3/gameplay_story_10626020","episode":"m